      "review_notes": "Design effectiveness and operational effectiveness are modeled as parallel assessment standards used by the same control-effectiveness evaluation action. No PRECEDES edge is created between design effectiveness and operational effectiveness. Functional_dependency edges represent: apply controls -> evaluate effectiveness as weak sequence reconstruction across adjacent rules; evaluate effectiveness -> effectiveness decision as outcome inference; remediation outputs as outcome inference from correction/redesign actions. The section does not specify whether design-defect remediation and operational-failure remediation are mutually exclusive or exhaustive, so those branches need human review. Unit v7u_N002770 is contextual and is not modeled as a graph node."
